{"id":"00216","root":"uni00216_1","name":{"ja":"ウェスタ","en":"Wester"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ウェスタ","en":"Wester"},"aliases":["Vesta","Westa"],"element":"Superhuman","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2019-07-16","limited":false,"characterId":160,"profile":{"ja":"獄炎の女王アスタロトが支配する灼熱の大地で、貴族として彼女に仕えている女魔族。ダークエルフ族の中でも白髪と黒い肌、特異な赤い目を持ち、災厄を招く子供として迫害されて育った。そんな彼女を初めて人として扱ったのがアスタロトで、ウェスタはそれ以来彼女に忠誠を誓っている。アスタロトの元で力をつけて多くの功績を上げると、彼女から直々に貴族の称号を得て、現在は獄炎の大地を守る一翼を担っている。ウェスタもアスタロトと同じく炎を操るが、彼女の炎は赤い獄炎ではなく、青く輝く炎である。また炎を操るだけでなく、素手での格闘術も得意である。そんなウェスタは女王の命を受け、人間界に赴きノマドとエドウィン・ブラックの動向を探ることになった。","en":"Wester is a demon noble serving Queen Astaroth, ruler of the scorching Infernal Lands. Among dark elves, she is distinguished by white hair, dark skin, and striking red eyes, and was persecuted as a child destined to bring disaster. Astaroth was the first to treat her as a person, and ever since, Wester has sworn loyalty to her. After gaining power and achieving many feats under Astaroth, she was personally granted a noble title and now helps guard the Infernal Lands. Like Astaroth, Wester manipulates fire, but her flames burn blue rather than the queen's red infernal fire. She also excels in unarmed combat. Acting on the queen's orders, Wester has traveled to the Human Realm to investigate the movements of Nomad and Edwin Black."},"illustrator":"ZOL","voiceActor":"疾風はる","forms":[{"id":"uni00216_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[722,1444],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[125,250],"def":[96,192],"spd":[54,54],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","250009"]},{"id":"uni00216_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1044,2088],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[200,400],"def":[142,284],"spd":[54,54],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","250009","250010"]},{"id":"uni00216_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1366,2758],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[275,545],"def":[188,376],"spd":[54,54],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge"