new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"私はウェスタ。魔界の女王アスタロトの下僕にして黒い肌と青い炎の貴族です","en":"I'm Wester, a noble of dark skin and blue flames, and a servant of Queen Astaroth of the Demon Realm."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00216_1/uni00216_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"我が陛下に仇なすものたちに、私の劫火で苦痛と死を。我が名はウェスタ、女王アスタロトを守る炎","en":"To anyone who dares offend my queen, I'll bring them pain and death with my searing fire. I'm Wester, the flame that guards Queen Astaroth."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00216_1/uni00216_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"私の心は、この肌と同じ闇色に塗り込められている。その闇に射す一条の光こそアスタロト陛下、私の希望","en":"My heart is stained the same darkness as my skin. The lone ray of light that cuts through it is Her Majesty Astaroth—my hope."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00216_1/uni00216_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"アスタロト陛下の命あれば、どこへでも行き、どんなことでもするのがこのウェスタの役目です","en":"As long as Her Majesty Astaroth lives, it's my duty—Wester's duty—to go anywhere and do anything."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00216_1/uni00216_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"魔界の灼熱の大地こそ我が封土。陛下より賜りし私の世界を脅かすものに苦痛に満ちた死を！","en":"The burning lands of the Demon Realm are my domain. Anyone who threatens the world bestowed upon me by Her Majesty will meet a death full of suffering!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00216_1/uni00216_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"女王陛下に仇なす者のまえにはこのウェスタの青い炎が立ちふさがると知りなさい","en":"Know that before anyone who dares betray the queen, my blue flame will block them."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00216_1/uni00216_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"魔界の女王アスタロト陛下の恩寵を受け、灼熱の封土をあずかる我が名はウェスタ。陛下の敵を滅ぼす青き炎","en":"Blessed by Queen Astaroth of the Demon Realm and entrusted with this scorching domain, I am Wester—wielding the blue flame that eradicates her enemies."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00216_1/uni00216_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"災厄そのものであるこのウェスタを寵愛してくださったのは、アスタロト女王陛下ただおひとり。我が忠誠はすべて陛下のために！","en":"Only Queen Astaroth has ever cherished this calamity-born Wester. My loyalty belongs entirely to Her Majesty!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00216_1/uni00216_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00216_1/uni00216_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00216_1/uni00216_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00216_1/uni00216_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00216_1/uni00216_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00216_1/uni00216_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00216_1/uni00216_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00216_1/uni00216_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00216_1/uni00216_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00216_1/uni00216_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00216_1/uni00216_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00216_1/uni00216_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00216_1/uni00216_1_rdy_1.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00216_